    narr:narration """This hub centers on the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), which defines the system's value as the capture of decision artifacts at the exact moment of consensus. This foundational framing, established in March 2026, has recently been operationalized through the team's [sprint delivery accounting](narr:Position_SprintDeliveryAccounting). By late July 2026, the team reported the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_1), framing the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_3) as the critical technical unlock for this capability. Alongside these functional milestones, the team has begun [quantifying sprint velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_2) as a primary metric of success, grounding the abstract goal of decision capture in concrete, measurable delivery cycles.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_SprintDeliveryAccounting> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "decision capture at the point of consensus" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We shipped the async decision widget." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Velocity was 23 points, highest this quarter." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Zephyr integration was the key unlock." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Tension exists between the qualitative goal of 'consensus capture' and the quantitative focus on 'velocity points' as the primary success indicator." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785148834287_2> ] ;
